# wave ice_AK ice_AK_p16 ice_AK_p84
# Ice absorption excess A_ice(lambda)/A_K toward the Galactic center / CMZ,
# from JWST NIRSpec G140M+G235M+G395M spectra of background stars (GO 6927,
# G0.253+0.016 'the Brick' field; 134 stars, median over stars of the rank-1
# amplitude x shape fit per band, saturated bins excluded).
# wave: wavelength [micron]; ice_AK: ice excess in units of A_K, relative to a
# CT06 (Chiar & Tielens 2006) Galactic center continuum anchored at 2.45-2.70
# and 5.04-5.24 micron; p16, p84: 16th/84th percentile of 300 bootstrap
# resamples over stars (statistical only).  Stars are assumed to be giants
# (Teff=4500 K, logg=2.5) when removing the stellar continuum.
# Source: NIRSpec_6927_ExtCurve_Model.py (A. Ginsburg, JWST GO 6927 analysis).
